<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasPredecessor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Adopted from the VDI 3682 ODP of Helmut Schmidt University. Two operators are never adjacent directly; the chain passes through the shared state."@en .
