<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Energy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.1."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "VDI 3682 Ontology Design Pattern"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#State> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 2, Figure 2 carries state as a class of the information model. Part 1, Section 4.1 deliberately avoids the term in the graphical notation because it is considered ambiguous there, and works with product, energy and information directly. This pattern follows Part 2."@en .
_:N31441510b06e447e8292db369b521286 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
